  "body": "The matrix-synapse server is is still using deprecated angular-js client.  a possible solution is the vector client can be installed on the server by uncompressing [a tar file from the download page](https://vector.im/packages/) editing the /etc/matrix-synapse/conf.d/webclient.yaml file so it points to directory were the uncompressed tar file. To finish the config.sample.json needs to be edited to contain the current homeserver address.\n",
